# Dependencies
/vendor/
go.sum

# IDE/Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Planning and temporary files
.planning/

# atcr review artifacts and local reviewer config. The config names agents from
# the user-level registry (~/.config/atcr/registry.yaml), so it is machine-local
# and a review run writes a full artifact tree under here.
.atcr/

# Semantic index data. These are rebuilt by 'llm-semantic index' and are
# derived from the source, so they do not belong in the repository.
.index/
.llm-index/
*_fts.db
*_fts.db-shm
*_fts.db-wal

# Environment and secrets
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key

# Local install script
install.sh
# Local binaries (installed to /usr/local/bin)
llm-support
llm-support-mcp

# Demos (work in progress)
demos/
ROADMAP.md
benchmarks/*.exe
llm-filesystem
llm-filesystem-mcp

# Scratch plan file. Committed by mistake in #60, untracked in #61, and
# committed by mistake again — `git add -A` picks it up every time.
/plan.md
